roving one operation.\n\nRESULT CF-028 | A1: Cannot tell | A2: Cannot tell | A3: No, not by itself | A4: Yes, weakly | A5: Yes | B1: Yes | B2: No | B3: No | B4: No | B5: No | B6: Yes"
